## Date and DateTime Views
Complete guide to Date/DateTime views with DateService integration
--

## Basic Date Input
Simple date input field
--
foam.CLASS({
  name: 'Example',
  properties: [
    {
      class: 'Date',
      name: 'birthDate',
      label: 'Birth Date'
    }
  ]
});

add(foam.u2.DetailView.create({data: Example.create()}));

